roduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:d41e7531c80b5d2734678c2227af824fcbbb3fb094d64d19a358e3b1d53c837b","file":"preprints/A-rational-obstruction-to-strong-chromatic-splitting-at-height-three-September-25-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex","line":45,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"18dd384ccbe783ac2286ec94860d2fd1ff2ca562b1a597984d4287d20c77f4c6","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/A-rational-obstruction-to-strong-chromatic-splitting-at-height-three-September-25-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:d41e7531c80b5d2734678c2227af824fcbbb3fb094d64d19a358e3b1d53c837b","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/A-rational-obstruction-to-strong-chromatic-splitting-at-height-three-September-25-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex#L45"},"statement_kind":"corollary","text":"\\label{cor:strong}\nFor every prime \\(p\\geq5\\), there is no equivalence of \\(E(2)\\)-local\nspectra \\(L_2L_{K(3)}S\\simeq\\mathcal W_3\\), with \\(\\mathcal W_3\\) as in\n\\eqref{eq:proposed-wedge}. Thus the height-three strong chromatic\nsplitting formula is false in this range, whether or not an equivalence\nis required to preserve its specified unit summand."}
